.TH MOXY-SERVE-MCP 1 "" "moxy"
.SH NAME
moxy-serve-mcp \- Run as MCP proxy server over stdio
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B moxy serve-mcp
.SH DESCRIPTION
Loads the moxyfile hierarchy, spawns child MCP servers, performs initialize handshakes, probes ephemeral servers, and serves as a unified MCP server on stdin/stdout. Shuts down gracefully on SIGINT/SIGTERM.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR moxy (1)
